{
  "uid": "catalyst-node-sync",
  "title": "Catalyst · Node Sync",
  "tags": ["catalyst", "node-sync", "freshness", "version"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "templating": { "list": [] },
  "annotations": { "list": [ { "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" }, "enable": true, "iconColor": "semi-dark-orange", "name": "Catalyst PR merged", "target": { "expr": "{service_name=\"catalyst.github\"} |= `github.pr.merged` |= `coalesce-labs/catalyst` | regexp `(?P<pr>PR #[0-9]+)` | line_format `merged {{.pr}}`", "queryType": "range", "refId": "prmerged" } }, { "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" }, "enable": false, "iconColor": "semi-dark-blue", "name": "Node restart (code live)", "target": { "expr": "{service_name=\"catalyst.broker\"} |= `stack.reload.complete` | line_format `{{.host_name}} restarted`", "queryType": "range", "refId": "restart" } } ] },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text", "id": 100, "transparent": true, "gridPos": { "h": 3, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": { "mode": "markdown", "content": "## Catalyst · Node Sync — is every node running the latest CODE and freshest DATA?\n**CODE**: `commits_behind` = how many commits each node's checkout is behind `origin/main` (**0 = on main** — this is the number to watch). `main` HEAD = the revision the up-to-date nodes run (currently derivable only from telemetry — no GitHub datasource wired). During a deploy a node may briefly show its **old + new revision** for ~5-15m while Prometheus expires the old series; trust `commits_behind`. **DATA**: replica **staleness** = how far behind live each node's local replica is (ms). **cursor** = the node's position in the **single global changefeed sequence** (linear + github share ONE sequence; its tip is driven by whichever source is busier — usually github). A node's cursor and the cloud head are the SAME sequence; the node reads the LIVE changefeed while 'cloud head' is derived from the cloud's ingest.committed LOG events, so a node can momentarily read a few seqs ABOVE the last-logged cloud head — telemetry vantage lag (seconds), NOT the node being ahead of the source. Nodes: **mini**, **mini-2** (full workers — emit version+heartbeat), **laptop** (`Ryans-MacBook-Pro-2`; ships logs via cloud-sync+updater, but its `catalyst.agent` is registered on the box yet **not emitting** version/heartbeat/spans — a workstation-agent gap, not a hard limit), **cloud** (mirror watermark only)." }
    },
    { "type": "row", "title": "Headline — fleet sync at a glance", "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 3 }, "id": 1, "collapsed": false },
    {
      "type": "stat", "title": "Max commits behind main", "id": 2,
      "description": "max(catalyst_vcs_commits_behind) across nodes. 0 = every reporting worker (mini/mini-2) is on origin/main. This is the reliable 'are we on latest code' number.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 5, "x": 0, "y": 4 }, "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [ { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "max(catalyst_vcs_commits_behind)", "instant": true } ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "none", "decimals": 0, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 }, { "color": "red", "value": 10 } ] } } },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none" }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat", "title": "main HEAD (running rev where behind=0)", "id": 3,
      "description": "The revision the up-to-date workers are running = origin/main HEAD (no GitHub datasource wired, so this is derived from telemetry). During a deploy two revisions may show briefly.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 5, "x": 5, "y": 4 }, "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [ { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "max by (vcs_ref_head_revision)(catalyst_build_info and on(host_name) (catalyst_vcs_commits_behind == 0) and on(host_name, vcs_ref_head_revision) (timestamp(catalyst_build_info) == on(host_name) group_left() max by(host_name)(timestamp(catalyst_build_info))))", "instant": true, "legendFormat": "{{vcs_ref_head_revision}}" } ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "blue", "value": null } ] } } },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "textMode": "name", "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none" }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat", "title": "Max Linear replica staleness", "id": 4,
      "description": "Worst local Linear replica age across nodes. staleness = how far behind live the node's replica is, measured as catalyst.linear.replica.staleness (ms) on the cloud-sync freshness line.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 5, "x": 10, "y": 4 }, "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "targets": [ { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" }, "expr": "max(last_over_time({service_name=\"catalyst.cloud-sync\"} |= `cloud-sync: freshness` | regexp `\"catalyst.linear.replica.staleness\":(?P<v>[0-9]+)` | unwrap v [5m]))", "queryType": "instant" } ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ms", "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 30000 }, { "color": "red", "value": 120000 } ] } } },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none" }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat", "title": "Replica apply failures (24h)", "id": 5,
      "description": "catalyst.replica.apply result=failed over 24h. Currently all = linear/issues state_id schema drift (OTL-42 / catalyst-cloud#127).",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 3, "x": 15, "y": 4 }, "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "targets": [ { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" }, "expr": "sum(count_over_time({service_name=\"catalyst.cloud-sync\"} |= `catalyst.replica.apply` |= `\"result\":\"failed\"` [24h]))", "queryType": "instant" } ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "none", "decimals": 0, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "orange", "value": 1 } ] } } },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none" }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat", "title": "Cloud head seq (global)", "id": 6,
      "description": "The cloud mirror's global changefeed tip = max headSeq across sources (github usually leads). Derived from ingest.committed LOG events, so it can trail a node's live cursor by a few seqs for seconds — they are the same sequence.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 3, "x": 18, "y": 4 }, "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "targets": [ { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" }, "expr": "max(max_over_time({service_namespace=\"catalyst-cloud\"} |= `ingest.committed` | regexp `\"headSeq\":(?P<h>[0-9]+)` | unwrap h [10m]))", "queryType": "instant" } ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "none", "decimals": 0, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "blue", "value": null } ] } } },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none" }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat", "title": "Nodes replicating", "id": 7,
      "description": "Distinct host_name emitting replica.apply in the last 10m (expect 3: mini, mini-2, laptop).",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 3, "x": 21, "y": 4 }, "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "targets": [ { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" }, "expr": "count(sum by (host_name)(count_over_time({service_name=\"catalyst.cloud-sync\"} |= `catalyst.replica.apply` [10m])))", "queryType": "instant" } ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "none", "decimals": 0, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 3 } ] } } },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none" }
    },
    { "type": "row", "title": "CODE freshness — is each node on the latest main?", "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 8 }, "id": 10, "collapsed": false },
    {
      "type": "table", "title": "Running code per node (current revision, deduped)", "id": 11,
      "description": "One row per worker = the currently-running build (freshest build_info series). During a deploy a node may briefly show two rows (old + new revision) until Prometheus expires the stale one — commits_behind is the reliable signal. laptop & cloud emit no build_info.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 9 }, "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [ { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "catalyst_build_info and on(host_name, vcs_ref_head_revision) (timestamp(catalyst_build_info) == on(host_name) group_left() max by(host_name)(timestamp(catalyst_build_info)))", "instant": true, "format": "table" } ],
      "transformations": [ { "id": "organize", "options": { "excludeByName": { "__name__": true, "Time": true, "Value": true, "job": true, "instance": true, "environment": true, "service_name": true, "otel_scope_name": true, "exported_job": true, "service_namespace": true, "host_id": true, "hostname": true, "catalyst_node_class": true, "service_instance_id": true, "resource_environment": true }, "indexByName": { "host_name": 0, "service_version": 1, "vcs_ref_head_revision": 2 }, "renameByName": { "host_name": "node", "service_version": "version", "vcs_ref_head_revision": "revision" } } } ],
      "options": { "showHeader": true }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries", "title": "Commits behind main per node (0 = on main)", "id": 12,
      "description": "catalyst_vcs_commits_behind by node. A step up = the node fell behind origin/main (needs a pull); back to 0 = caught up. mini/mini-2 only.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 9 }, "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [ { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "catalyst_vcs_commits_behind", "legendFormat": "{{host_name}}" } ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "none", "decimals": 0, "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 15, "stepAfter": true, "lineWidth": 2, "spanNulls": true } } },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["last", "max"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } }
    },
    {
      "type": "logs", "title": "Code-pull vs restart timeline (plugin.checkout.updated · stack.reload.complete · broker.daemon.startup)", "id": 13,
      "description": "When each node last re-checked-out code and restarted. A plugin.checkout.updated with NO following stack.reload.complete = code pulled but daemon not restarted (running stale). mini/mini-2.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 15 }, "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "targets": [ { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" }, "expr": "{service_name=~\"catalyst\\\\.(execution-core|broker)\"} |~ `plugin.checkout.updated|stack.reload.complete|broker.daemon.startup` | line_format `{{.host_name}}  {{.event_name}}`", "queryType": "range" } ],
      "options": { "showTime": true, "sortOrder": "Descending", "wrapLogMessage": true, "enableLogDetails": true, "dedupStrategy": "none" }
    },
    { "type": "row", "title": "DATA freshness — replica sync (Linear + GitHub)", "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 22 }, "id": 20, "collapsed": false },
    {
      "type": "timeseries", "title": "Linear replica age per node (staleness over time, ms)", "id": 21,
      "description": "How far behind live each node's local Linear replica is. Measured as catalyst.linear.replica.staleness (ms) on the cloud-sync freshness line. Lower = fresher.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 23 }, "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "targets": [ { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" }, "expr": "avg_over_time({service_name=\"catalyst.cloud-sync\"} |= `cloud-sync: freshness` | regexp `\"catalyst.linear.replica.staleness\":(?P<s>[0-9]+)` | unwrap s [$__interval]) by (host_name)", "queryType": "range", "legendFormat": "{{host_name}}" } ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ms", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 2 } } },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["last", "max", "mean"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries", "title": "Global changefeed cursor per node + cloud head (full seq)", "id": 22,
      "description": "Each node's global changefeed cursor vs the cloud head — SAME sequence, two vantage points. They should overlap. The node reads the live changefeed; 'cloud head' comes from ingest.committed log events, so the node line can sit a few seqs above cloud head for seconds after each batch (telemetry lag, not real lead). A node falling PERSISTENTLY below cloud head = genuinely behind.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 30 }, "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" }, "expr": "last_over_time({service_name=\"catalyst.cloud-sync\"} |= `cloud-sync: freshness` | regexp `\"catalyst.linear.replica.cursor\":(?P<c>[0-9]+)` | unwrap c [$__interval]) by (host_name)", "queryType": "range", "legendFormat": "cursor {{host_name}}" },
        { "refId": "B", "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" }, "expr": "max(max_over_time({service_namespace=\"catalyst-cloud\"} |= `ingest.committed` | regexp `\"headSeq\":(?P<h>[0-9]+)` | unwrap h [$__interval]))", "queryType": "range", "legendFormat": "cloud head" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "none", "decimals": 0, "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 0, "lineWidth": 2 } }, "overrides": [ { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "cloud head" }, "properties": [ { "id": "custom.lineStyle", "value": { "fill": "dash" } }, { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "purple" } } ] } ] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["last"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries", "title": "Replica apply rate by source & result — ACTIVITY (not freshness)", "id": 23,
      "description": "Rows/interval applied by source (linear/github) and result. This is sync THROUGHPUT/activity, not staleness. result=failed in red.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 37 }, "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "targets": [ { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" }, "expr": "sum by (source, result)(count_over_time({service_name=\"catalyst.cloud-sync\"} |= `catalyst.replica.apply` | regexp `\"result\":\"(?P<result>[a-z]+)\"` | regexp `\"source\":\"(?P<source>[a-z_]+)\"` [$__interval]))", "queryType": "range", "legendFormat": "{{source}} {{result}}" } ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "none", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 2 } }, "overrides": [ { "matcher": { "id": "byRegexp", "options": ".*failed.*" }, "properties": [ { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" } } ] } ] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["last", "sum"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } }
    },
    { "type": "row", "title": "Per-node — mini", "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 44 }, "id": 30, "collapsed": false },
    { "type": "stat", "title": "mini · commits behind main", "id": 31, "description": "How many commits mini is behind origin/main. 0 = on latest.", "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 5, "x": 0, "y": 45 }, "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "targets": [ { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "max(catalyst_vcs_commits_behind{host_name=\"mini\"})", "instant": true } ], "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "none", "decimals": 0, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 } ] } } }, "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background" } },
    { "type": "stat", "title": "mini · running rev", "id": 32, "description": "Current running revision (freshest build_info). May briefly show 2 during a deploy.", "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 5, "y": 45 }, "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "targets": [ { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "catalyst_build_info{host_name=\"mini\"} and on(host_name, vcs_ref_head_revision) (timestamp(catalyst_build_info{host_name=\"mini\"}) == on(host_name) group_left() max by(host_name)(timestamp(catalyst_build_info{host_name=\"mini\"})))", "instant": true, "legendFormat": "{{vcs_ref_head_revision}}" } ], "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "textMode": "name", "colorMode": "value" } },
    { "type": "stat", "title": "mini · Linear staleness", "id": 33, "description": "Age of mini's local Linear replica (ms).", "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 5, "x": 11, "y": 45 }, "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" }, "targets": [ { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" }, "expr": "last_over_time({service_name=\"catalyst.cloud-sync\"} |= `cloud-sync: freshness` | host_name=`mini` | regexp `\"catalyst.linear.replica.staleness\":(?P<v>[0-9]+)` | unwrap v [5m])", "queryType": "instant" } ], "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ms", "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 30000 } ] } } }, "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background" } },
    { "type": "stat", "title": "mini · cursor (global seq)", "id": 34, "description": "mini's position in the global changefeed sequence (full integer). Same sequence as cloud head; may read a few seqs above it briefly due to telemetry vantage — see the trends panel.", "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 5, "x": 16, "y": 45 }, "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" }, "targets": [ { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" }, "expr": "last_over_time({service_name=\"catalyst.cloud-sync\"} |= `cloud-sync: freshness` | host_name=`mini` | regexp `\"catalyst.linear.replica.cursor\":(?P<c>[0-9]+)` | unwrap c [5m])", "queryType": "instant" } ], "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "none", "decimals": 0 } }, "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "none" } },
    { "type": "stat", "title": "mini · heartbeat/10m", "id": 35, "description": "node.heartbeat count in 10m — liveness. 0 = daemon not heartbeating.", "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 3, "x": 21, "y": 45 }, "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" }, "targets": [ { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" }, "expr": "sum(count_over_time({service_name=\"catalyst.execution-core\"} |= `node.heartbeat` | host_name=`mini` [10m]))", "queryType": "instant" } ], "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "none", "decimals": 0, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 } ] } } }, "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background" } },
    { "type": "row", "title": "Per-node — mini-2", "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 49 }, "id": 40, "collapsed": false },
    { "type": "stat", "title": "mini-2 · commits behind main", "id": 41, "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 5, "x": 0, "y": 50 }, "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "targets": [ { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "max(catalyst_vcs_commits_behind{host_name=\"mini-2\"})", "instant": true } ], "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "none", "decimals": 0, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 } ] } } }, "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background" } },
    { "type": "stat", "title": "mini-2 · running rev", "id": 42, "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 5, "y": 50 }, "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "targets": [ { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "catalyst_build_info{host_name=\"mini-2\"} and on(host_name, vcs_ref_head_revision) (timestamp(catalyst_build_info{host_name=\"mini-2\"}) == on(host_name) group_left() max by(host_name)(timestamp(catalyst_build_info{host_name=\"mini-2\"})))", "instant": true, "legendFormat": "{{vcs_ref_head_revision}}" } ], "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "textMode": "name", "colorMode": "value" } },
